[0.006, "o", "\u001b[1m\u001b[38;5;221mENGINE◆\u001b[0m \u001b[1m\u001b[32m❯\u001b[0m pd up --dir .\r\n\r\n  Config: .portdaddyrc\r\n  Detected 1 service(s):\r\n\r\n    api  local        → porthole-service-proof:app:main\r\n\r\n\u001b[90m│\r\n\u001b[34m●\u001b[39m  Starting: api\r\n\r\n  Claiming ports...\r\n    api  → 19876\r\n\r\n\u001b[36mapi\u001b[39m | atlas-api listening on 19876\r\n\u001b[90m│\r\n\u001b[32m◆\u001b[39m  api healthy (port 19876)\r\n\r\n\u001b[90m│\r\n\u001b[32m◆\u001b[39m  All 1 service(s) running. Press Ctrl+C to stop.\r\n  Dashboard: /\r\n\r\n\r\n\u001b[90m│\r\n\u001b[33m▲\u001b[39m  Shutting down...\r\n\r\n\u001b[90m│\r\n\u001b[33m▲\u001b[39m  All services stopped.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n"]
